# Anti Failed Stock Decrement Concern

## Scope
Ensure stock always decrements on successful payment using atomic operations - payment success must trigger stock decrement, failure must not decrement stock.

## Out of Scope
Complex payment workflows beyond single payment→stock decrement, manual stock correction, distributed transaction beyond CMS atomic operations.

# Aftermath target
After completion: payment success always triggers stock decrement atomically, payment failure never decrements stock, stock decrement verification after payment. No successful payment without stock decrement.

## Definition of Done
[ ] Payment success triggers decrement: atomic stock decrement on payment success
    [ ] Verification: `console.log('TRACE: Payment success, decrementing stock', { requestId, productId, quantity })` on payment success
    [ ] Verification: `console.log('TRACE: Stock decremented', { productId, oldStock, newStock })` after decrement
    [ ] Test: Process successful payment, verify stock decremented
[ ] Payment failure no decrement: no stock change on payment failure
    [ ] Verification: `console.log('TRACE: Payment failed, no stock decrement', { requestId, error })` on payment failure
    [ ] Test: Process failed payment, verify stock unchanged
[ ] Decrement verification: verify decrement after payment
    [ ] Verification: `console.log('TRACE: Stock decrement verified', { productId, expectedStock, actualStock })` after decrement
    [ ] Test: After payment, verify stock matches expected value
